  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/IMG_8625.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(92 fotos) El grupo Monopole ha inaugurado este viernes su nueva showroom en la factor&iacute;a de Onda, situada en el kil&oacute;metro 9 de la carretera CV-20, junto a la campa de camiones municipal, que comparte con Mar&iacute;tima Ceramics, dedicada a ambientes de barco.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioshowroommonopole/img_8516.jpg\" alt=\"img_8516\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioshowroommonopole/img_8517.jpg\" alt=\"img_8517\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioshowroommonopole/img_8518.jpg\" alt=\"img_8518\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioshowroommonopole/img_8519.jpg\" alt=\"img_8519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioshowroommonopole/img_8520.jpg\" alt=\"img_8520\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioshowroommonopole/img_8521.jpg\" alt=\"img_8521\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioshowroommonopole/img_8522.jpg\" alt=\"img_8522\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioshowroommonopole/img_8523.jpg\" alt=\"img_8523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioshowroommonopole/img_8524.jpg\" alt=\"img_8524\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><im